1. audit-oe-skill — https://github.com/htlin222/audit-oe-skill
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

`skills/oe-verify/SKILL.md` is derived from `audit-oe-skill` by Hsieh-Ting Lin.
Specifically, the following originate there and are reproduced or adapted here:

  - the `origin` ROT-1 decode
  - the corpus -> risk tier rules (HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW) and the corpus name list
  - the "transitive citation" failure-mode framing and its trace-back stage
  - the verification architecture: N parallel per-citation agents plus a single
    stronger cross-citation contradiction agent
  - the contradiction severity ladder (CRITICAL / WARNING / NOTE, >20% threshold)

